    # LOCATION: the places the book prints as headings -- its nine stories are set wherever the troupe's saga is,
    # so there is no root: The Champion's Portion's provinces of the regio, Dundrum and Dún Rudraige; The Ship of
    # Desire's docks and ship; Fall and Rise's supply cache, tower and Corfe Castle; The Hospital's Due's town,
    # priory and Enrico's house; Lady Martha's domain; A Musical Murder Mystery's village, church and hostel;
    # Return of the Raiders' village sites; Warring Families' village, church and the cult's lair; What Lies
    # Beneath's marsh, abbey and burial ground. A place's text is in its chapter's .lore, under its heading.

